# Model files: required runtime assets, kept via Git LFS (see .gitattributes).
# Do NOT ignore backend/models/best.pt(.zip) - YOLO detector loads them.

# Large datasets: backend/dataset (+dataset.zip) is the intentional training
# deliverable referenced by COLAB_TRAINING_GUIDE.md - keep tracked.
# backend/dataset/images/train/*
# backend/dataset/images/val/*
# backend/dataset/images/test/*

